{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11290","headline":"得广州张判官叔卿书使还以诗代意 · 杜甫","name":"得广州张判官叔卿书使还以诗代意","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乡关胡骑远，宇宙蜀城偏。\n忽得炎州信，遥从月峡传。\n云深骠骑幕，夜隔孝廉船。\n却寄双愁眼，相思泪点悬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_11290.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11290","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}